[anyone, "cp_nihilistic_3", [], "Nothing, really. I am merely a soul who found sanity after abandoning common sense. Can you not see how pointless our struggle is ? You've raised an army and an empire, for what trivial purpose ? Centuries come and go, and they bring nations with them to a grave beyond our sight. Why do you cling to the belief that your efforts will ever be rewarded by anything ? Why do you insist on finding reason behind each and every action ?", "cp_nihilistic_4", [] ],
